      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-03-30T18:34:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;arenson9&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"arenson9\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"SlenderTroll\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/slendertroll/48/2832_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> SlenderTroll:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Hurra! Anyone know what was up?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>While the &gt;G staff were away, critical files for the forum were zeroed-out. How or why that happened is not clear.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It seems that this error is a known problem with the forum software where race conditions in the database can lead to a file being overwritten with no information. I’m not 100% sure that this is what happened to these forums, but steps have been taken to block that particular problem from occurring.</p>",
